@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' Define the main components
component "User Application" as user_app
component "VMT Manager" as vmt_manager
component "VMT Driver" as vmt_driver
component "SteamVR/OpenVR Runtime" as steamvr_runtime

' Define the interfaces
interface "OSC Interface" as osc_interface
interface "Shared Memory (JSON)" as shared_memory
interface "OpenVR Driver Interface" as openvr_interface

' Define the relationships
user_app --> osc_interface : Provides\ncontrol input
osc_interface --> vmt_manager : Receives\nexternal input

vmt_manager --> shared_memory : Exchanges JSON\nmessages
shared_memory --> vmt_driver : Exchanges JSON\nmessages

vmt_driver --> openvr_interface : Integrates with\nruntime
openvr_interface --> steamvr_runtime : Loaded by

' Add notes for additional context
note right of vmt_manager
  - Receives external control input
  - Manages communication with driver
  - Exchanges JSON messages through shared memory
end note

note right of vmt_driver
  - Exposes virtual motion tracking to SteamVR
  - Integrates through OpenVR driver interface
  - Loads legacy controller binding for 'mycontroller'
end note

note bottom of shared_memory
  - Bidirectional JSON communication
  - Synchronization fields:
    * Send count
    * Handshake count
    * Message length
end note

@enduml